    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard Procedures  is a casual &quot;tactical&quot; team-based physics-based shooter about gunfights and negotiation with an active ragdoll character controller. The game focuses on creating dynamic gameplay facilitated by the often unpredictable nature of the physics engine. Create plans with friends of how to approach any situation- either with your unique brand of violence, or, if the time is right: negotiation and reason.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are two teams:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Zelenomash gang, named after the Zelenomash Factory, is a group of criminal factory workers and other outlaws. The regular life wasn't for them, so they chose to live by the law among thieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, their racket has brought them increased attention from the interior, and most importantly, S.M.O.G, who are a special police task force designated with stopping street gangs and organized crime with violent force and prejudice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every body part is physically simulated and can interact with the environment and other players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every limb (and your head!) can be broken or blasted off your body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen different weapons to choose from, from shotguns to rocket launchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced inventory system with individual hand control- dual wield anything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your team and your enemies using proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 7 of your friends in a single lobby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team deathmatch mode, where Zelenomash and S.M.O.G. fight to the death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostage mode, where Zelenomash have a captive citizen, and S.M.O.G. must negotiate for their release.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Standard Procedures  is a casual &quot;tactical&quot; team-based physics-based shooter about gunfights and negotiation with an active ragdoll character controller. The game focuses on creating dynamic gameplay facilitated by the often unpredictable nature of the physics engine. Create plans with friends of how to approach any situation- either with your unique brand of violence, or, if the time is right: negotiation and reason.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There are two teams:</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Zelenomash gang, named after the Zelenomash Factory, is a group of criminal factory workers and other outlaws. The regular life wasn't for them, so they chose to live by the law among thieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, their racket has brought them increased attention from the interior, and most importantly, S.M.O.G, who are a special police task force designated with stopping street gangs and organized crime with violent force and prejudice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every body part is physically simulated and can interact with the environment and other players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every limb (and your head!) can be broken or blasted off your body.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over a dozen different weapons to choose from, from shotguns to rocket launchers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An advanced inventory system with individual hand control- dual wield anything!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate with your team and your enemies using proximity voice chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to 7 of your friends in a single lobby.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team deathmatch mode, where Zelenomash and S.M.O.G. fight to the death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostage mode, where Zelenomash have a captive citizen, and S.M.O.G. must negotiate for their release.</p></li></ul>",
